{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10133140","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10133140","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1013314001:1":{"text":"この二つの石碑には、人々が聖石を聖石町の中心に移したと記されているわ。聖石町の名前の由来でもあるわね。","source_cn":"这两块石碑，上面记录了人们将圣石移至圣石镇中心。圣石镇...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A0DC2CEB6494C0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013314002:1":{"text":"現地の調査で分かったんだけど、当時傀儡と呼ばれていた魔像も、ほぼ同時期に活動を停止しているの。","source_cn":"我们在本地走访得知，当时尚没有被称为魔偶的傀儡们，也几...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3B1F50F242AA82C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1013314003:1":{"text":"そして最近になって魔像がまた動き出したことで、私たちは聖石と魔像の関係を疑うようになったのよ。","source_cn":"魔偶最近重新开始活动，引发了我们对圣石和魔偶关联的猜测。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAD4DC6FB86A1536","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1013314004:1":{"text":"でもここから先は私の研究分野じゃないのよね。そうだ、あなたたち<style=\"highlight\">傀儡の古戦場</style>にはもう行った？","source_cn":"但这部分研究，并不是我的专长。唔……等等。你们去过<s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF2EDA83796A6354","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1013314004":{"text":"でもここから先は私の研究分野じゃないのよね。そうだ、あなたたち<style=\"highlight\">傀儡の古戦場</style>にはもう行った？","source_cn":"但这部分研究，并不是我的专长。唔……等等。你们去过<style=stress>傀儡古战场</style>吗？","status":"matched","h